<title>USA: University of So. Carolina, won by Interstate. [corrected 21:28 gmt]</title>
<headline>University of So. Carolina, won by Interstate. [corrected 21:28 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate/Johnson Lane Corp.</p>
<p>said it won $25 million of University of South Carolina, revenue</p>
<p>bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.874 (corrects from 5.784) percent.</p>
